  <para style="h">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ikete ryanditswe na Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yuda</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yud</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ikete ryanditswe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yuda</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JUD 1" />
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JUD 1:1" />Jewe Yuda, umukozi wa Yesu Kristo n’umuvukanyi wa Yakobo,</para>
  <para style="po" vid="JUD 1:1">Ndabandikiye mwebwe abahamagawe, mukundwa n’Imana Data kandi muzigamwe na Yesu Kristo:<verse eid="JUD 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="po">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JUD 1:2" />Imbabazi, amahoro n’urukundo bibe muri mwebwe bigwiriye.<verse eid="JUD 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Urubanza rw’abigisha b’ibinyoma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JUD 1:3" />Bene Data nkunda, naho nari nipfuje cane kubandikira ku bijanye n’agakiza dusangiye, numvise ngoberwa kwandika ndabahimiriza ngo mugwanire ukwizera abera b’Imana bahawe rimwe rizima. <verse eid="JUD 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JUD 1:4" />Ibi ndabivuze kuko hari abantu batubaha Imana binjiye muri mwebwe binyegeje, bakigisha ko ubuntu bw’Imana butwemerera kugendera mu buhumbu. Igihano c’abantu nk’abo cari caravuzwe mu vyanditswe kuko bahakana Yesu Kristo, ari we Databuja wenyene n’Umwami.<verse eid="JUD 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JUD 1:5" />Naho mwari musanzwe mubizi vyose, ndashaka kubibutsa ko Umwami Imana yatabaye ubwoko bw’Abisirayeli akabukura mu gihugu ca Egiputa, ariko hanyuma yahoneje abatizeye bo muri bo. <verse eid="JUD 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JUD 1:6" />Kandi n’abamarayika batagumye mu bibanza Imana yabashizemwo, ariko bagahitamwo kubivamwo, Imana yabugaraniye ahantu h’umwijima, baboshwe n’iminyororo y’ibihe bidashira, barindiriye wa musi uhambaye w’imanza. <verse eid="JUD 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JUD 1:7" />Kandi mwibuke Sodomu na Gomora n’ibisagara vyari bihakikije. Abantu baho bihaye gukora ivyaha vy’ubuhumbu n’ivy’ubusambanyi vy’ubwoko bwose. Ni co catumye Imana ibatangako akarorero mu kubahanisha umuriro, igabisha abantu ko hari igihano c’umuriro udashira.<verse eid="JUD 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JUD 1:8" />Uko ni ko n’abo bantu bagendera mu ndoto zabo, bonona imibiri yabo, bagasuzugura ububasha bw’Imana bagatuka ivy’icubahiro vyo mw’ijuru. <verse eid="JUD 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JUD 1:9" />Ariko na Mikayeli, Umumarayika mukuru, aho yariko araharira na Satani bapfa umuvyimba wa Mose, ntiyubahutse kumutuka, ariko yavuze ati: “Uhoraho aguhane!” <verse eid="JUD 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JUD 1:10" />Ariko abo bantu bo batuka ivyo badatahura. Bameze nk’ibikoko bitazi ubwenge kandi ivyo bibaza ngo barazi ni vyo bibahonya.<verse eid="JUD 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JUD 1:11" />Abo bazobona ibara! Bajanye inzira ya Kayini, bakurikira amaronko maze bagwa mu mutego Balamu yaguyemwo; bazohona kuko bagararije nka Kora.<verse eid="JUD 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JUD 1:12" />Kubana na bo iyo musangira mu misi mikuru y’urukundo nk’abizera ni agatetereza, kandi ivyo babikora ata co basonera. Bameze nk’abungere biragira ubwabo. Bameze nk’ibicu bitagira imvura bikubebwa n’umuyaga. Bameze kandi nk’ibiti bitagira ivyamwa mu gihe c’iyera, vyaranduranywe n’imizi bipfa kabiri. <verse eid="JUD 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JUD 1:13" />Ibikorwa biteye isoni vyabo vyiyerekana nk’ifuro rikwiragizwa n’imipfunda yo mu kiyaga. Bameze n’inyenyeri ziyerera, zabikiwe gutererwa mu cobo c’umwijima w’umuzitanya w’ibihe bidashira.<verse eid="JUD 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JUD 1:14" />Enoki, uwo mu runganwe rugira indwi inyuma ya Adamu, yavugishijwe kuri abo bantu ati: “Raba Uhoraho azananye n’ibihumbi n’ibihumbi vy’abamarayika bera, <verse eid="JUD 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JUD 1:15" />aje gucira imanza abantu bose, no kwemeza abanyavyaha bose ibikorwa vyo kutubaha Imana bakoze, n’ibitutsi vyose abatubaha Imana bayitutse.” <verse eid="JUD 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JUD 1:16" />Abo bantu ni abanyamwikomo bama bidodombera abandi; bakurikira ivyipfuzo vyabo bibi; barishira hejuru kandi bakoresha amajambo meza babesha abandi mu kurondera inyungu.<verse eid="JUD 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imburi n’impanuro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JUD 1:17" />Ariko mweho bakundwa, mwibuke ivyo intumwa z’Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo zari zaravuze imbere y’igihe. <verse eid="JUD 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JUD 1:18" />Bababwiye bati: “Mu bihe vy’iherezo hazobaho abacokoranyi bakurikira ivyipfuzo vyabo vyo kutubaha Imana.” <verse eid="JUD 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JUD 1:19" />Abantu nk’abo ni bo babacamwo ibice, bakurikira ivyipfuzo vyabo vy’ab’isi gusa, ntibagira Mpwemu.<verse eid="JUD 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JUD 1:20" />Ariko mweho, bakundwa, mwiyubake mu kwizera kwanyu kwera cane kandi musengere muri Mpwemu Yera. <verse eid="JUD 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JUD 1:21" />Mwizigamire mu rukundo rw’Imana mu kurindira ko Umwami wacu Yesu Kristo, mu mbabazi ziwe, abaha ubugingo budashira.<verse eid="JUD 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JUD 1:22" />Mugirire impuhwe abakekeranya. <verse eid="JUD 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JUD 1:23" />Mukize abandi mubakure mu muriro w’urubanza. Mwerekane imbabazi ku bandi ariko zivanze no gutinya. Yamara mwirinde no gukora ku mpuzu zandujwe n’imibiri yabo yandujwe n’ivyipfuzo vyabo bibi.<verse eid="JUD 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Gushima Imana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JUD 1:24" />Imana irashoboye kubazigama ngo ntimugwe no kubashikana imbere y’ubwiza bwayo mutagira ico mwogawa kandi munezerewe cane. <verse eid="JUD 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JUD 1:25" />Ni yo Mana yonyene n’Umukiza wacu. Icubahiro, ubukuru, inkomezi n’ububasha bibe ivyayo, biciye muri Yesu Kristo Umwami wacu, uhereye kera hose, ubu no gushitsa ibihe bidashira! Amen.<verse eid="JUD 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JUD 1" />
</usx>